# Raw dataset drops. Globbed, not numbered one by one: real_dataset_6..9 and
# real_dataset_target_spot were sitting untracked on the HPC because the list
# stopped at 5, and a stray `git add -A` would have committed them.
real_data_*
real_dataset_*
kaggle_plant_village_dataset

# Datasets are never committed; they live on the HPC and are far too large.
# This does NOT stop `git pull` creating data/real_environment_dataset/'s 10 class
# folders: their .gitkeep files are already TRACKED, and .gitignore has no effect
# on tracked files. It does mean the images you download into them stay ignored.
data/*